      "raw": "```cpp\n#include <iiXml>\n\niiXml::Parser::TagParser parser;\n\nQObject::connect(&parser, &iiXml::Parser::TagParser::TagParsed,\n    [](const QString& TagName, const QString& Value) {\n        // TagName, Value 사용\n    });\n\nparser.ParseTag(\"<number>숫자</number>\");\n```\n",
      "language": "cpp",
      "code": "#include <iiXml>\n\niiXml::Parser::TagParser parser;\n\nQObject::connect(&parser, &iiXml::Parser::TagParser::TagParsed,\n    [](const QString& TagName, const QString& Value) {\n        // TagName, Value 사용\n    });\n\nparser.ParseTag(\"<number>숫자</number>\");\n",
